msgstr "Dodaj do konta"

#: openexpress/gui/add_to_account.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Add {model} to Your Garmin Account?"
msgstr "Dodać {model} do konta Garmin?"

#: openexpress/gui/add_to_account.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"openExpress sends Garmin the description of the device (its "
"GarminDevice.xml, with its Unit ID) and adds it to the account {account} as "
"an active device. Then a sync uploads its activities and health data to this "
"account.\n"
"\n"
"If the device is paired with the Garmin Connect app on a phone, check first "
"that the app uses the same account. A device can be removed from an account "
"only in Garmin Connect.\n"
"\n"
"This is an experimental feature."
msgstr ""
"openExpress wyśle do Garmina opis urządzenia (plik GarminDevice.xml z jego "
"numerem Unit ID) i doda je do konta {account} jako aktywne. Potem "
"synchronizacja wyśle na to konto jego aktywności i dane o zdrowiu.\n"
"\n"
"Jeśli urządzenie jest sparowane z aplikacją Garmin Connect na telefonie, "
"sprawdź najpierw, czy aplikacja używa tego samego konta. Usunąć urządzenie "
"z konta można tylko w Garmin Connect.\n"
"\n"
"To funkcja eksperymentalna."

#: openexpress/gui/add_to_account.py
msgid "On your Garmin account already"
msgstr "Już na koncie Garmin"

#. TRANSLATORS: heading of the message after Garmin accepted a device that the
#. account's list does not show yet
#: openexpress/gui/add_to_account.py
msgid "Device Not Listed Yet"
msgstr "Urządzenia jeszcze nie ma na liście"

#: openexpress/gui/add_to_account.py
msgid ""
"Garmin accepted the device, but the account's list does not show it yet."
msgstr "Garmin przyjął urządzenie, ale lista konta jeszcze go nie pokazuje."

#: openexpress/gui/add_to_account.py
msgid ""
"Refresh in a few minutes. If it is still missing, check the devices of your "
"account in Garmin Connect."
msgstr ""
"Odśwież za kilka minut. Jeśli nadal go nie ma, sprawdź urządzenia swojego "
"konta w Garmin Connect."

#: openexpress/gui/add_to_account.py
msgid "Garmin Accepted the Device"
msgstr "Garmin przyjął urządzenie"

#: openexpress/gui/add_to_account.py
msgid ""
"The account's list could not be read to check it. Refresh in a few minutes; "
"if the device is still missing, check the devices of your account in Garmin "
"Connect."
